[{"id":3341641510,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7HLWcm","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?u=b7882c94f408976a2f79e8fe6e1ce27fbd48db74&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The changes make sense to me.\r\n\r\nLSP defines `TextDocumentContentChangeEvent` in a way where `range` and `rangeLength` are optional. However we don't even use them, so from my side the better solution would be to remove those members completely from the codebase. They are related to a change sync mode that we don't support currently.\r\n\r\nThe fields on `TextDocumentItem` are required by the spec, however we also use this struct to load `TextDocumentIdentifier` which only has a uri, so the changes make sense based on the current implementation. If this gets merged I will change those back in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105236, which removes the double usage.\r\n","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111684#pullrequestreview-3341641510","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111684"